+        /// <summary>
+        ///     An ExternalImages PNG exactly 2x, 3x or 4x the size of the MUL art is an HD version of it (tools/hd-art in
+        ///     UO Offline makes these): it goes on an HD atlas page so it draws at the art's own size. Any other size is
